c
c this is comments, will not be read
c
c first thing to specify should be a line starting with `p cfg num_terminals num_nonterminals num_rules` 
c then a line with `t name_terminal1 name_terminal2 ...`
c then a line with `n name_nonterminal1 name_nonterminal2`
c the set of termianls and nonterminals should be disjoint
c then num_rules lines where the first element is the lefthand-side of the rule and the right is the ORs of possible transitions
c using (non)terminals that have not been pre-specified should terminate the execution
c all rule lines should terminate with a `0`
c no (non)terminal can be named `0`
c (non)terminals may only be named uint32 numbers 
c the start symbol is the first declared nonterminal 
c add a line `START 0` to the rules if the start symbol is nullable
c .cnfg only accepts rules written in Chomsky Normal Form